      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I strongly agree, this feature should be integrated again. I am left-handed, and due to my personal bindings, I had the \"left\" action menu bound to my right controller B button. This allowed me to open it with my right hand but control it naturally with my left hand joystick. Having to navigate the action menu with my right hand joystick feels extremely unnatural and has actually become quite uncomfortable to use (also because my right joystick is a bit messed up and struggles with more than just moving left or right).",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
